sels developed to boost survival rates. As of 2020 they can propagate 40 acres in a day.</p>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-09-06T07:12:06.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"nglgzz/awesome-clean-tech","categoryHTML":"<h2>Companies</h2><h3>Vegetation &#x26; Agriculture</h3>","itemHTML":"<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.vultus.io/\">Vultus</a> | Sweden | 2016</p>\n<p>Uses satellite imaging to save fertilizer usage up to 30%, and track crops health. This allows farmers to reduce their Nitrous Oxide emissions, a greenhouse gas that is 298 times more potent than CO2.</p>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-09-06T07:12:06.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"nglgzz/awesome-clean-tech","categoryHTML":"<h2>More Resources</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.norrsken.org/\">Norrsken Foundation</a> - Swedish foundation which supports and invests in organizations that have a positive impact on society.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-09-06T07:12:06.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"typeddjango/awesome-python-typing","categoryHTML":"<h2>Tools</h2><h3>Mypy plugins</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gordonbondon/kubernetes-typed\">kubernetes-typed</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/gordonbondon/kubernetes-typed\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">10</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":10,\"repo\":\"gordonbondon/kubernetes-typed\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - Plugin for kubernetes <a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/\">CRD</